OL,3,GNEWSANI saw largest rise in disposable
OL,4,Aincome of any UK region
OL,5,
OL,6,FReal disposable income per person in
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland rose by 4.1% in 2024,
OL,8,Fthe biggest rise of any UK region, new
OL,9,Ffigures suggest.
OL,11,FThat growth was likely influenced by
OL,12,Fsharp, inflation-linked increases in
OL,13,Fbenefits, pensions and the minimum
OL,14,Fwage.
OL,16,FThe figures, from the Office for
OL,17,FNational Statistics (ONS), estimate the
OL,18,Famount of money that people have for
OL,19,Fspending or saving after they have paid
OL,20,Ftaxes and received benefits.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
