OL,3,GNEWSANI saw largest rise in disposable
OL,4,Aincome of any UK region
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland has a relatively high
OL,7,Fproportion of people on minimum wages
OL,8,Fand receiving benefits. That means when
OL,9,Fthose payment rates change it can have
OL,10,Fan outsized impact in Northern Ireland.
